---
// Describes what this website actually does today. Update it if analytics, a form backend
// or other tracking is added.
// TODO: have this reviewed by the hospital's legal/compliance advisor before launch.
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy policy" description={`How the ${SITE.name} website handles your personal information.`} updated="October 2026">
  <p>
    {SITE.name} ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information this website handles and how
    it is used. Medical records created during your care at the hospital are covered separately by the hospital's
    patient privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Information you share with us</h2>
  <p>
    The appointment and call-back forms on this website do not store your details on our web server. When you submit a
    form, it opens WhatsApp with your name, phone number and concern already typed in, and nothing is sent until you
    press send in WhatsApp. Messages you send us on WhatsApp, by phone or by email are seen only by our care team and are
    used to arrange your appointment and respond to your enquiry.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services on this website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>WhatsApp</strong> (Meta) handles messages you choose to send us. Its own privacy policy applies.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> supplies the typefaces used on this site, which means your browser connects to Google's servers.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Maps</strong> is embedded on our contact page to show our location.</li>
    <li><strong>YouTube</strong> videos, when played, load from YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers may receive technical information such as your IP address and browser type.</p>

  <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>This website does not currently use analytics or advertising trackers.</p>

  <h2>How we protect your information</h2>
  <p>
    Information you share with our care team is used only to provide and arrange your care, is not sold, and is shared
    only where needed for your treatment or where required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us what information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by writing to
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name}, {SITE.address}. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or call
    <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '')}`}>{SITE.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
